# DEFAULT. Mixes THREE free quota pools (Gemini free tier + OpenCode free + OpenRouter :free)
# so one pool running dry does not stop the whole workflow, and the reviewer is a different
# model family (and a different provider) than the builder.
# Roles:
# - PLAN   : Google (gemini-4-hydrogen) - best free reasoning for planning.
# - BUILD  : OpenCode (deepseek-v4.1-flash-free) - fast, zero-retention.
# - REVIEW : OpenRouter (nemotron-3-ultra-550b :free) - biggest free model, different family from builder.
# - TEST   : OpenCode (glm-5.3-flash-free) - cheap and quick, zero-retention.
# Notes:
# - gemini-4-argon and gemini-4-carbon have NO free API tier; gemini-4-hydrogen and gemini-3.8-flash do (rate-limited).
#   Check your limits at https://aistudio.google.com/rate-limit
# - OpenCode free models are "free for a limited time". deepseek-v4.1-flash-free and glm-5.3-flash-free are documented
#   as zero-retention. big-pickle and the mimo models may use your data for training: avoid them for private code.
# - OpenRouter :free models are rate-limited (low requests/min and per day unless the account has credits) and
#   some free endpoints log prompts: check each model's privacy notes before using private code.
# - Fallback if the OpenRouter reviewer is rate-limited: google/gemini-3.8-flash
PLAN_MODEL=google/gemini-4-hydrogen
BUILD_MODEL=opencode/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free
REVIEW_MODEL=google/gemini-3.8-flash
TEST_MODEL=opencode/glm-5.3-flash-free
